      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T12:51:04.000Z",
      "text": "Another option is to end double-blind review. It used to work well, but it removes accountability. Authors who submit AI slop should take the reputational hit, very simple.\n\nMore complex rules just lead to unintended consequences and are just too difficult to enforce. https://t.co/4ZNaU1kwML",
      "url": "https://x.com/_amirbar/status/2101655379696316630",
      "isQuote": true,
      "metrics": {
        "likes": 11,
        "retweets": 0,
        "replies": 0,
        "quotes": 0
      },
      "engagementScore": 11,
      "highEngagement": false,
